{"id": "E21", "category": "multi_turn", "input": ["帮我查下 ORD001", "能不能退款"], "expected": {"intent": "refund_query", "tools": ["get_order", "check_refund_eligibility"], "key_params": {"order_id": "ORD001"}, "must_have": [["退款"]], "tools_required": true}, "note": "多轮：第一轮查订单，第二轮指代该订单问退款"}
